  (text "03 - ALWAYS-ON SUPPLY / IMPLEMENTED CORE"
    (at 25.4 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "95d6cb07-15c9-4a41-bcb3-efa83ccccf81")
  )
  (text "RT tied to internal VCC: nominal 1 MHz. VCC supplies only RT selection and C4; no external load.\n15 uH, 2 x 22 uF output are nominal prototype values; effective C / saturation / ripple / MPN remain to qualify.\nPGOOD unused. AON reset is supervised separately by TPS3808G33. EN follows protected bootstrap feed."
    (at 25.4 132.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f8e13fa3-b833-4f3b-b6ff-20adcb043616")
  )
  (text "INTERFACE / ASSEMBLY GATES\nLimited native-OR bootstrap feeds are captured. AON_BOOTSTRAP_IN is not raw stack or unprotected USB.\nCoordinated entry protection and cold-start/ramp qualification remain pending.\nChosen fixed-output DC allocation: 3.2505-3.3825 V; max G33 release 3.1928 V; static margin 57.7 mV.\nStartup budget target 0.200 W (old ceiling 0.250 W); transients, lower-feed startup and attach current unmeasured.\nPWR_FLAG on generated +3V3_AON declares the real buck output through L1; no flag declares missing input/return.\nAccepted RPE prototype lands differ from TI contour; common 0.100 / 0.125 mm stencil still to reconcile."
    (at 25.4 164 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "115001d4-8ed7-49b8-8ca4-c940e5a1cce0")
  )
